# "decada" (also written with the Portuguese-style accent "década") is
# attested in native running text on the Mirandese Wikipedia (Biquipédia),
# e.g. category titles "Catadorie:Década de 1850" and "Catadorie:Década de
# 2000" (mwl.wikipedia.org). Both spellings are listed since Mirandese
# orthography does not consistently mark this accent (mirrors the pt
# unit_decade.voc accented/unaccented pair).
décadas
década
decadas
decada
